    <ns0:title>v1.19.0 - Trace Your Workflows, Layer by Layer</ns0:title>
    <ns0:content type="html">&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dify 1.19.0 brings nested workflow tracing to your observability tools.&lt;/strong&gt; Follow a workflow into the Workflow Tools it calls, inspect the steps inside each invocation, and keep the LLM context alongside the execution tree.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This release also makes Workflow Tools portable with App packages, adds Skill Hub automation, and makes Agent files easier to upload and preview. The bu</ns0:content>
