    <ns0:link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://github.com/langgenius/dify/releases/tag/1.18.0" />
    <ns0:title>v1.18.0 — Smarter Agent Routing, Portable Apps, Deeper Workflow Visibility</ns0:title>
    <ns0:content type="html">&lt;p&gt;Dify 1.18.0 brings &lt;strong&gt;Agents that route workflows&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;portable app packages&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;deeper visibility into nested workflow runs&lt;/strong&gt;, and the opt-in &lt;strong&gt;Agent Knowledge Base&lt;/strong&gt; experience. OpenAPI and the new difyctl expand how you build and manage apps from the command line.&lt;/p&gt;
