    <ns0:content type="html">&lt;h2&gt;🚀 What's New in v1.14.1?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;v1.14.1 is a patch release focused on security hardening, workflow and knowledge-base stability, deployment cleanup, and continued UI platform migration after v1.14.0.&lt;/p&gt;
